# =========================================================================
# Pipeline caches
# =========================================================================
# Any MAT file produced while experimenting is ignored by default.
*.mat

# The four caches of the pipeline are the exception: they are committed, so
# that the results can be inspected and every figure reproduced without
# rerunning the calibration or the thirty-year simulation. They are small
# because each stage saves an explicit list of variables rather than the
# whole workspace, and they carry no absolute paths.
#
#   PreProcessed_Data.mat     ~0.8 MB
#   Smoothed_Data.mat         ~1.2 MB
#   Calibration_Results.mat   ~0.1 MB
#   Long_Simulations.mat      ~0.7 MB   (the ten rescaling factors only)
#
# The negations must stay AFTER the *.mat rule above, or they have no
# effect.
!PreProcessed_Data.mat
!Smoothed_Data.mat
!Calibration_Results.mat
!Long_Simulations.mat

# =========================================================================
# MATLAB working files
# =========================================================================
*.asv
*.autosave
*.m~
slprj/
sccprj/
codegen/
*.mex*
*.mlappinstall
*.mltbx

# =========================================================================
# Figures exported locally
# =========================================================================
# The scripts only display their figures; nothing is written to disk. These
# rules cover figures a user exports by hand.
*.png
*.pdf
*.eps
*.fig
*.svg
*.tif

# =========================================================================
# Manuscript drafts (not for public distribution)
# =========================================================================
*.docx
*.doc

# =========================================================================
# Operating system
# =========================================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
